<p>The strongest conceptual upgrade is CONTENT INTENSITY. We have now seen =
the same pattern independently in timing, measurement, vacuum and package c=
hemistry: as AI hardware gets more complex, the value or quantity of obscur=
e enabling inputs per unit can rise faster than headline system volumes. Th=
e kernel should therefore model d(content/unit)/dt for every physical input=
, not only end-market demand growth.</p>
